; Production compiler assembled directly as ordered ATOM parts.
; Entry metadata supplies the immutable profile and the caller selects origin.
; Boundary-only parts preserve extents without adding exports to reusable leaves.
; Symbol lookup must fall through into DGSET without intervening bytes.
